A||N||35||Haze_Performance||Any interest in custom notchback taillights?||||5||
Z||000000||Haze_Performance||10-23-2001||04:29 AM||||I'm working on light-up PONTIAC & FORMULA script for notchback taillights. The light-up will be available in: Red - Blue - Yellow - Purple & Green. This wont just be a sticker inside of the lens. It will be replaceable color plates. (So you can change them whenever you want) I would also like to do custom script (Whatever you want) & maybe custom colors like Orange - Pink (For the ladies  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ) + more. I should have the red set done for my car in a week or 2. Is there any interest? I will be selling kits that include: 2 reconditioned notchback taillights with script of your choice, 2 color plates of your choice, 2-4 light sockets & bulbs (depends on the length of script), tube of sealer & instructions. The lens would be ready to bolt right in. (after you hook up the extra sockets).    <P><BR>Let me know what you guys/gals think.<P>Thanks for the space.<BR>-Haze  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallindysig_copy.jpg">                 .                 <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallredsig.jpg">           <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> - Pennocks Wild Rides - <A HREF="http://clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||5
