Z||000003||Haze_Performance||10-23-2001||05:49 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by onfire:<BR><B>My thumb is up. I was going to buy Paul V.'s light up Pontiac lights. But if I can have it say something different, that would be better. <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>To tell you the truth... I was thinking of how to make a light-up PONTIAC for notchbacks about 2 years ago. Then last year Paul came out with his & I put mine on hold. I like his kit but I wanted more than a decal inside. I guess nows the time to come out with mine.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Ill keep ya updated. <P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>Carl--It won't do me any good as I have a fastback, but I think it's a great idea.  (It's also good to know that I'm not the only fool up at odd hours.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Odd hours? You mean I should be sleeping now?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>---------------------------<P>Any other interest?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallindysig_copy.jpg">                 .                 <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallredsig.jpg">           <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> - Pennocks Wild Rides - <A HREF="http://clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||14
