Z||000013||Haze_Performance||10-24-2001||05:20 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MikeSchaefer:<BR><B>Great idea Haze!!!!!  That looks real cool<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTFiero1:<BR><B>what about these bad boys?  <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I email APC (the place that makes all the clear w/red round lights for Import cars) & am trying to have a taillight made for the Fiero. I haven't heard back yet. <P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Spiff:<BR><B>I'd be interested in a set that say "Formula" in the correct font. Any idea on price?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'm not set on a price yet. I still waiting for someone to do the vinyl in bulk. I will keep everyone posted. (Yes, the Formula will be in Fiero Font)<P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ferrari_cdn:<BR><B>I would be interested.  You say custom script, like I could have it say what I would like?  Any idea on pricing or character limits?  Soemthing like 8 or 9 characters?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Depending on the Font & Script, I will do anything people want. If you backup light space is not important, I can span text from red lens to red lens. DXR has a very cool backup light relocate mod that would go very nicely with someone that want a large amount of text.   <P><BR>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallindysig_copy.jpg">                  .                  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallredsig.jpg">            <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> - Pennocks Wild Rides - <A HREF="http://clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 10-24-2001).]||||reg||10
