Z||000030||Ferrari_cdn||11-13-2001||01:25 AM||||This might be silly but how about being able to have two sets of lights for the script.  For example, coloured bulbs will light the script red for normal operation but if you go into reverse, the red lights go out and white ones come on so you have a white script?  I realize this would mean complex electronic wiring to make it work.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000031||Haze_Performance||11-13-2001||01:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ferrari_cdn:<BR><B>This might be silly but how about being able to have two sets of lights for the script.  For example, coloured bulbs will light the script red for normal operation but if you go into reverse, the red lights go out and white ones come on so you have a white script?  I realize this would mean complex electronic wiring to make it work.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>NEWS: I'm still looking for the colored vinyl. As for your idea.. Yes it will work, but (theres always a but  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ) I would have to use colored bulbs & not colored vinyl. It should look pretty cool.. I'll look into that..<P>Thanks for the idea..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlife.gif">   <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="purple">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||7
Z||000032||Ferrari_cdn||11-13-2001||12:48 PM||||Possible to have two colours at the same time, like for example, ICEFIERO and the word ICE is white and FIERO is blue?<P>Just throwing ideas here   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>*EDIT*   Just got off the phone with the vehicle standards.  I knew I might not be able to use white.  They also said blue is illegal (police colour).  But they have no idea about colours other than red, like green.  They told me they will contact me later after contacting the national vehicle standards.  Also will contact them for whether it's possible to have multi-colours.<p>[This message has been edited by Ferrari_cdn (edited 11-13-2001).]||||reg||1
